{"type":"message","id":"2469431c","parentId":"94219a51","timestamp":"2026-05-21T12:16:20.307Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] I can handle the **full crypto news pipeline** end to end 🎯\n\n**What I can do**\n- start a fresh pipeline run\n- delegate research → writing → image generation → Drive upload → WordPress publish\n- validate each step before moving on\n- stop safely if a stage fails\n- give you the real links/outputs only after they exist\n- continue from the current run when possible\n\n**Best commands to use**\n- `run crypto pipeline`\n- `start pipeline`\n- after Drive is ready: `publish this to wp`\n\n**About DM vs group**\n- You’re right: **DM is usually smoother for approvals/permissions**\n- In groups, some exec-style steps can get blocked or ask for approval\n- In DM, the same flow is more likely to run cleanly\n\n**What I can’t do automatically**\n- I can’t move the conversation to your DM by myself\n- You need to message me there first, then I can run the pipeline from that chat\n\nIf you want, send me **“run crypto pipeline” in DM**, and I’ll use that as the main place for future runs."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":30959,"output":484,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31443,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779365759612,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DhwbidbE5SJ7dh6FbFiGEZAF2dCu4"}}
