{"type":"message","id":"9d919273","parentId":"b645f94d","timestamp":"2026-05-21T12:17:20.747Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Yes — if that agent is available to me, I can call it directly.\n\nRight now I can directly spawn these agents:\n- `researcher`\n- `writer`\n- `creator`\n- `publisher`\n- `wp-publisher`\n- `chart-generator`\n\nSo you can ask things like:\n- `call researcher only`\n- `run writer on current research`\n- `generate image with creator`\n- `upload docx with publisher`\n- `publish to wp with wp-publisher`\n\nIf you want, you can also be very specific, like:\n- `call researcher and save output`\n- `call writer for this run only`\n- `call creator without publishing`\n- `call wp-publisher now`\n\nIf you want, I can also tell you **what each agent does** in one line each."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":835,"output":173,"cacheRead":30848,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31856,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779365833293,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DhwcuSSWWNrBLJe4LmLBpa0houwtZ"}}
